{"id":240,"name":"magby","speciesId":240,"dex":240,"form":"normal","generation":2,"types":["fire"],"stats":{"hp":45,"attack":75,"defense":37,"special-attack":70,"special-defense":55,"speed":83},"abilities":[{"name":"flame-body","hidden":false},{"name":"vital-spirit","hidden":true}],"height":7,"weight":214,"baseExp":73,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/240.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/240.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/240.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/240.ogg","genus":"Live Coal Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Carvão Vivo","flavor":[{"version":"gold","text":"Each and every time it inhales and exhales, hot embers dribble out of its mouth and nostrils."},{"version":"silver","text":"It is found in volcanic craters. Its body temp. is over 1100 degrees, so don't under­ estimate it."},{"version":"crystal","text":"It naturally spits an 1100-degree flame. It is said when many appear, it heralds a volcanic eruption."},{"version":"ruby","text":"MAGBY’s state of health is determined by observing the fire it breathes. If the POKéMON is spouting yellow flames from its mouth, it is in good health. When it is fatigued, black smoke will be mixed in with the flames."},{"version":"emerald","text":"If a MAGBY is spouting yellow flames from its mouth, it is in good health. When it is fatigued, black smoke will be mixed in with the flames."},{"version":"firered","text":"It is found in volcanic craters. Its body heat exceeds 1,100 degrees Fahrenheit, so don’t underestimate it."},{"version":"diamond","text":"Its body temperature is around 1,100 degrees F. It is healthy if it is breathing yellow flames."},{"version":"platinum","text":"Its magma-like blood circulates throughout its body. Its body’s heat can top 1,100 